### GET ALL USERS
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

### GET USER BY UUID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/{{uuid}}
Content-Type: application/json

### GET USER BY QRCODE
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/qrcode/{{qrcode}}

### MAKE NEW USER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userFirstName": "Jay",
  "userLastName": "Li",
  "userEmail": "jayli@cn.com"
}

### EDIT EXISTING USER
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/{{uuid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userFirstName": "Scott",
  "userLastName": "Riddler",
  "userEmail": "sriddler@rdl.com"
}

### DELETE USER BY UUID
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/7dec0d97-84c4-4d2b-8e06-b0cc8d85b322
Content-Type: application/json

### DELETE USER'S QRCODE
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/{{uuid}}/qrcodes/{{qrcode}}

### ADD USER'S QRCODE
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/{{uuid}}/qrcodes

### EDIT USER'S QRCODE
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/{{uuid}}/qrcodes/{{qrcode}}
